      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "for masterTextureLimit it would be interesting to see in action. I suspect somewhat unoptimized avatars would be reigned in, but optimized avatars would find their textures reduced possibly beyond recognition.\n\nI now have an idea for yet another test avatar, thanks.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
